(1,'KEEP',[I,XI],'numerical','Photon recoil and orbital drift of a tumbling torch','Complete orbital story provides power, period, spin orientation, time and orbit altitude. Photon momentum, averaged thrust, rigid-body rotation and Newtonian orbital perturbations estimate drift. Torch mass/emission geometry are declared estimate inputs; no alien or relativistic theory is needed.'),
