(9,'BORDERLINE',[II],'theory','Standing elastic modes of two welded metal cylinders','A one-dimensional axial mode interpretation needs only ordinary compression waves and interface matching. The statement does not specify polarization or free/support conditions; a complete finite-cylinder spectrum includes unprovided flexural/3D elasticity. Intended physics breadth is uncertain.'),
