(31,'KEEP',[],'theory','Bose-gas mode eigenvalues under a fully supplied PDE and polynomial ansatz','The full differential eigen-equation, trap potential, parameters and product-form ansatz are visibly printed. Substitution, coefficient matching and algebraic root conditions give the spectrum; the condensate interpretation does not require quantum statistics.'),
(32,'KEEP',[III,XII],'data_analysis','Radon diffusivity from a measured decay-activity ratio','Ordinary diffusion/conservation and supplied half-life give a steady spherical source-diffusion-decay equation. Integrating the activity and inverting the ratio estimates D under a declared freely escaping surface condition; no specialized nuclear reaction law is missing.'),
